Richard Bos wrote:
> Janis Papanagnou <Janis_Papanagnou@hotmail.com> wrote:
> 
>>Does anybody know whether the Chromatic Dragon is edible? Some spoiler
>>says that he might even confer petrification resistance; is that true?
>>I always thought that resistance to stoning is restricted to monsters.
> 
> She. But no. She _does_ have MR_STONE in her conferred intrinsics list,
> meaning that _she_ could confer stoning resistance; but unfortunately
> intrinsic_possible(), in eat.c, does not allow for STONE_RES, which
> means that, no matter what she could, _you_ cannot get stoning
> resistance, from any monster including her.

Thank's for the responses.

